。你们谈话间都心照不宣地避开了导致安心神不宁的原因——彼岸地下的污染样本。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302010,"trial_step":10},{"step":18,"content":"只找到这些吗？可这是个男孩。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302011,"trial_step":11},{"step":19,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"辛迪加的治安官普遍没有记录执勤内容的习惯，您要的“和佩儿年龄相近的狂厄者信息”，都在这里了。","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302012,"trial_step":12},{"step":20,"content":"算了，试一试吧，希望这一次她能做出合理的选择。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302013,"trial_step":13},{"step":21,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您究竟要做什么？真的不需要警卫同行吗？","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302014,"trial_step":14},{"step":22,"content":"不用，我和安一起去就行。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302015,"trial_step":15},{"step":23,"content":"副官依然用不信任的眼神看着你。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302016,"trial_step":16},{"step":24,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您每次在审查后带禁闭者出勤，都会做些出格的事。","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302017,"trial_step":17},{"step":25,"options":["哦，是吗？","……这次不会有意外的"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302018,"trial_step":18,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"哦，是吗？","goto":19},{"text":"……这次不会有意外的","goto":null}]},{"step":26,"content":"你们沿着夜莺给的地图一路向西，但并没有见到治安官所说的小男孩。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302019,"trial_step":19},{"step":27,"speaker":"安","content":"不能再往前了，前面是锈河，到处都是游荡的死役，仅凭我们两个人很难活着出来。","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302020,"trial_step":20},{"step":28,"speaker":"安","content":"马上就要天黑了，这里恐怕也不太安全。","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302021,"trial_step":21},{"step":29,"options":["那我们明天再来？","再等等吧"],"style":6,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302022,"trial_step":22,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"那我们明天再来？","goto":23},{"text":"再等等吧","goto":24}]},{"step":30,"content":"说不定这他临时有事出去了？","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302023,"trial_step":23,"next":[25]},{"step":31,"content":"以狂厄者的身体情况应该走不