ent":"诶——原来安是辛迪加人，那还真是不容易啊。","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302084,"trial_step":84},{"step":92,"speaker":"患者","content":"我就没有那么大志向，在黑帮混出点名堂就行。不过我是再也不敢碰那些怪武器了。","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302085,"trial_step":85},{"step":93,"speaker":"安","content":"是吗？那之前是谁说一定要做个有钱人的~","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302086,"trial_step":86},{"step":94,"speaker":"患者","content":"诶？那不是那个内科医师吗？","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302087,"trial_step":87},{"step":95,"speaker":"医师","content":"我？我只想结束志愿工作后早点回新城，妻子还等着我呢。","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302088,"trial_step":88},{"step":96,"speaker":"安","content":"那佩儿呢？长大想做什么？","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302089,"trial_step":89},{"step":97,"speaker":"佩儿","content":"做什么都行！只要和安姐姐一起就行！","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302090,"trial_step":90},{"step":98,"speaker":"安","content":"哈哈哈，这算什么理想啊？","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302091,"trial_step":91},{"step":99,"speaker":"佩儿","content":"哎呀你笑什么！我认真的咳咳咳咳……","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302092,"trial_step":92},{"step":100,"speaker":"安","content":"好啦，跟屁虫小姐，先吃药吧，啊——","style":1,"background":104,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302093,"trial_step":93},{"step":101,"speaker":"安","content":"如果，我答应过会救你，却没能做到，你的梦想也没有办法实现，你真的不会怪我吗？","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302094,"trial_step":94},{"step":102,"speaker":"男孩","content":"烦不烦啊，你不是问过一遍了吗，都说了和你没关系了。","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302095,"trial_step":95},{"step":103,"speaker":"安","content":"好……","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302096,"trial_step":96},{"step":104,"content":"男孩有些不耐烦地瞅着原地出神的安。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302097,"trial_step":97},{"step":105,"speaker":"男孩","content":"喂，她真的没事吧，怎么又哭又笑的？","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":260302098,"trial_step":98},{"step":106,"options":["现